      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-03-11T06:06:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It is documented that state residency for any given power entity can fail to be returned, which would be indicated by missing data. I\u0027m not sure that a separate return status adds any value here.",
      "parentUuid": "a97eda3e_f9b1f6d4",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 108,
        "startChar": 12,
