      "writtenOn": "2021-03-11T22:19:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What are the reasons why these things might not be available? It sounds like the channel/consumer/entity might exist, but the implementation can just randomly fail to collect/report it for no reason.",
      "parentUuid": "d779aad5_21c3578f",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 108,
        "startChar": 12,
